MODEL WEIGHTS ARE NOT IN THIS PACKAGE
================================================================================

The library loads model.fermion + config.json of FermionResearch/Phonon-2.5-English, Phonon-2.5 or Phonon-2, downloaded separately, each with its own
licence and NOTICE.

================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY ALGORITHMS
================================================================================

The 512-point real FFT of the front end follows the radix-4/radix-2 real-input algorithm of pocketfft
(Copyright (C) 2010-2019 Max-Planck-Society, BSD-3-Clause; https://gitlab.mpcdf.mpg.de/mtr/pocketfft), re-implemented
here for the fixed size; no pocketfft source file is included.
